                "text": "In recent weeks, #AZ01 doctors & patients have been left in limbo as private health care decisions are debated in Arizona's court system. Today, I voted to pass two bills to protect women's access to essential health care. Now, the Senate must do the same. https://t.co/oPmX9nuSI2",
